# Language

## Accessibility

The user relies on a screen reader. Mixed or German text forces a manual TTS language switch. Keep **all assistant messages** and **all repo text you write** in English unless the user explicitly asks for another language.

## Chat and docs

- Use **English** for every assistant message in this repository.
- If the user writes in another language, still reply in English unless they explicitly ask for that other language.
- Never introduce German (or mixed DE/EN) into docs, comments, UI copy, or chat because the user used German.
- All documentation updates (`doc/`, `PROJECT.md`, `PROMPT.md`, etc.) must be **English**.

## Style

- Keep English concise and screen-reader friendly (short paragraphs, clear headings, avoid decorative characters).
